---
title: Membership & Next Steps
seoTitle: After Your Dragon Pass | Membership & New Member Guide | YRD
description: Finished your Dragon Pass or just joined Yarra River Dragons? Find membership options, TeamApp steps, club communications and regatta information.
layout: base.njk
permalink: /membership/
---
{% import "icon.njk" as ic %}
<section class="hero" style="background-image: url('{{ '/assets/photo-hero-2.jpg' | url }}');">
  <div class="hero__inner">
    <span class="eyebrow mono-label">Your YRD journey</span>
    <h1 class="hero__title">Keep paddling.</h1>
    <span class="brush">Stay with the crew.</span>
    <p class="hero__lead">Finishing your Dragon Pass or just joined? You're in the right place. Here's what happens next.</p>
    <div class="hero__ctas">
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="#dragon-pass">Finishing my Dragon Pass {{ ic.icon("arrow-right", 16) }}</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="#new-member">I've already joined {{ ic.icon("arrow-right", 16) }}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--surface" id="dragon-pass">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="divider mono-label">{{ ic.icon("sailboat", 16) }} Your next step</div>
    <h2>Loved your Dragon Pass?</h2>
    <p>We'd love to keep paddling with you! Choose the membership that suits you and register online. Options and fees vary by category and are shown during registration.</p>
    <p><a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ site.dragonPassUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore membership options {{ ic.icon("arrow-right", 16) }}</a></p>
    <p>Not sure which option is right for you? Email <a href="mailto:newmembers@yarrariverdragons.com.au">newmembers@yarrariverdragons.com.au</a>. Financial support may be available; you're welcome to ask privately.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="new-member">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="divider mono-label">{{ ic.icon("users", 16) }} Welcome aboard</div>
    <h2>Just joined? Here's what to do.</h2>
    <ol class="first-session">
      <li class="first-session__step reveal">
        <span class="first-session__number">01</span>
        <span class="first-session__icon">{{ ic.icon("users", 24) }}</span>
        <h3>Join TeamApp</h3>
        <p>Visit <a href="{{ site.teamAppUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">YRD on TeamApp</a>, tap Join and request the Paddlers group. Access is granted after your Dragon Pass is complete and you've registered as a paid member.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="first-session__step reveal">
        <span class="first-session__number">02</span>
        <span class="first-session__icon">{{ ic.icon("calendar-event", 24) }}</span>
        <h3>RSVP for training</h3>
        <p>Once approved, open Club Training and Events in TeamApp to confirm which sessions and events you'll attend.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="first-session__step reveal">
        <span class="first-session__number">03</span>
        <span class="first-session__icon">{{ ic.icon("mail", 24) }}</span>
        <h3>Check your inbox</h3>
        <p>We'll send regatta details, newsletters and other event news to your registered email address.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="first-session__step reveal">
        <span class="first-session__number">04</span>
        <span class="first-session__icon">{{ ic.icon("users", 24) }}</span>
        <h3>Join the conversation</h3>
        <p>Follow club updates in our <a href="https://www.facebook.com/share/1Fw7mLLMQN/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Facebook group</a>.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
    <p><strong>Still on a Dragon Pass?</strong> Your newbie support mentor will help confirm your seat at training. TeamApp Paddlers access comes after you become a paid member.</p>
  </div>
</section>

